  "bio": "Renowned for his proficiency in black and gray realism, Josh Walker is a highly skilled tattoo artist whose work speaks volumes of his talent. Operating from Black Anvil Tattoo Club in Cleethorpes, UK, Josh's meticulous attention to detail and finesse have earned him a respected position in the tattoo community, as well as a sponsorship by Ink of Coco Tattoo Skincare. Clients and tattoo enthusiasts alike are continually impressed with the artistry and sophistication that Josh brings to each piece he creates.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\nTattoo Artist\n12 years experience\nBlack & Grey\nScunthorpe, UK 🇬🇧\n@holymountaintattoo\n\nTattoo Artist\n12 years experience\nBlack & Grey\nScunthorpe, UK 🇬🇧\n@holymountaintattoo",
